  ## \large Can We Apply The Model To Real Data?
  {All models are wrong, but some are useful. (George Box)} \\ 
  
  \visible<2->{Is exponential growth a useful model?}
  \visible<3->{
  
    * Possibly for describing some populations during short time
      periods, e.g. invasive species
    * Also useful as foundation for more realistic models
  
  
